            "title": "Potash maker Nutrien to sell stake in Argentina's Profertil for $600 million",
            "description": "",
            "summary": "The stake will be acquired jointly by agribusiness companies Adecoagro and Asociacion de Cooperativas Argentinas (ACA) through an 80%-20% partnership, the companies said.  Nutrien said that oil and gas producer YPF, which holds the remaining 50% stake in Profertil, will have 90 days to exercise its right of first refusal.  In March 2024, Reuters reported that Nutrien was mulling the sale of Argentina, Chile and Uruguay assets after steep losses in the region.",
